        'Open [[nav.settings]] › [[sw.fam.modes]] › [[sw.sub.ft8]] › [[nav.automation]] and, in the [[auto.b5]] box, tick “[[auto.autoCqOn]]”. In the “[[auto.autoCq]]” field type after how many minutes with no CQ to answer Aurora should call CQ (2 to 120; ticking the box starts it at 5).',
